  "note": "ATTEN3's calibrated range ends at 2900 mV (ESP32-S3 Table 5-6). The 10 k pull-up serves the 85-101 degC hardware trip (thermal_block / C32), so the node is above 2900 mV below 28.6-35.7 degC (v3v3 3.242-3.367 V; VALID from ~23.9 degC at the low corner): the channel reads SATURATED (colder than the bound) at most room temperatures. An open sensor also reads SATURATED; the board's HS_OPEN comparator latches it in hardware (C13)."
 },
